# HASUT stage loop

Before implementing: inspect the repo, state current architecture, list affected modules, then plan.

After implementing: lint, typecheck, tests, security (authz/PII/uploads), UX states, update `docs/`, summarize files, give manual verification steps.

Do not claim a feature complete without tests. Do not break existing behavior to add scope.

Work only the requested sprint/stage. Sprint order is in `docs/product/sprint-breakdown.md`.
